CONSTITUTION OF THE BOARD

6.(1) The administration, management and control ofthe affairs of the Institute shall be vested in a Board ofGovernors (hereinafter referred to as the “Board”).

(2) The Board shall, for the purpose of administering theaffairs of the Institute, exercise, discharge and perform, thepowers, functions and duties conferred on, or assigned to, orimposed on the Institute by this Act.

7.(1) The Board shall consist of—

(a)the following ex-officio members, namely–

(i)the Secretary to the Ministry of theMinister or his representative;

(ii)a representative from the Ministry ofthe Minister assigned the subject ofFinance, nominated by the Secretary tothe Treasury;

(iii)the Chief Executive Officer of the SriLanka Transport Board;

(iv)the Director General of the Tertiary andVocational Education Commission;

(v)the Director- Principal of the Instituteappointed under section 17 of this Act;and

