POWERS AND FUNCTIONS OF THE COUNCIL

14.The functions of the Council shall be-

(b)to facilitate, coordinate, supervise andmonitor research relating to science andtechnology in respect of grants provided tohigher educational institutions, public sectorresearch institutes and other governmentalinstitutions so as to ensure the efficientutilization of government investments inresearch;

